                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Lincoln to Mr.
                            Blaine.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Legation of the United States</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >London</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1891-03-24"><hi rendition="#italic">March 24,
                        1891</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Bayett Michael Hazzard appointed British member Samoan land commission last July.
                    Now in Samoa.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Lincoln.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
